(6486595, 964638, 108069, '<td valign="top">Clever. Well-spotted scene. Nice tones as well. Nice work.</td>', 'Clever. Well-spotted scene. Nice tones as well. Nice work.', '2011-08-01 07:07:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6486601, 964452, 135204, '<td valign="top">Great shot of San Francisco.  Love all the lights and nice sky, but I thought there would be some more reflections in the water.</td>', 'Great shot of San Francisco.  Love all the lights and nice sky, but I thought there would be some more reflections in the water.', '2011-08-01 07:36:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6486603, 964939, 135204, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic, having the red barn in the shot is excellent.  It does feel like the trees on the left are somewhat under exposed.  But with such dramatic differences in light the only way to change that would be to blend multiple exposures, which can be lots of frustrating work.  Anyway I really like your shot and hope it does well.</td>', 'Very dramatic, having the red barn in the shot is excellent.  It does feel like the trees on the left are somewhat under exposed.  But with such dramatic differences in light the only way to change that would be to blend multiple exposures, which can be lots of frustrating work.  Anyway I really like your shot and hope it does well.', '2011-08-01 07:40:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6486605, 964326, 136168, '<td valign="top">great image and capture!! I feel it would work even better as a panorama, there''s too much negative space on bottom...</td>', 'great image and capture!! I feel it would work even better as a panorama, there''s too much negative space on bottom...', '2011-08-01 07:42:03.000000', NULL, 1),
