(6486803, 964938, 117474, '<td valign="top">I''m loving the sense of scale in this! I would have hit it through topaz detail (or done equivalent stuff in photoshop if I knew how!) cause it has a sense of softness to my eyes. Or maybe just sharpened it. It''s also a bit noisy so a bit of denoising software mightn''t have gone amiss either. <br/>I might have also tried sepia on this. The monodont bluey-greeney seems a little... dull :-) Nice skyscape, as I said. <br/>I''ve got a cloud fetish. <br/>Also, not voting, just commenting.</td>', 'I''m loving the sense of scale in this! I would have hit it through topaz detail (or done equivalent stuff in photoshop if I knew how!) cause it has a sense of softness to my eyes. Or maybe just sharpened it. It''s also a bit noisy so a bit of denoising software mightn''t have gone amiss either. I might have also tried sepia on this. The monodont bluey-greeney seems a little... dull :-) Nice skyscape, as I said. I''ve got a cloud fetish. Also, not voting, just commenting.', '2011-08-01 11:09:55.000000', NULL, 1),
