(6486840, 964699, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great perspective. If the image were a little cleaner (seems to be a lot of artifacts from noise reduction or sharpening, I can''t tell which) I think this could have done really well.</td>', 'Great perspective. If the image were a little cleaner (seems to be a lot of artifacts from noise reduction or sharpening, I can''t tell which) I think this could have done really well.', '2011-08-01 11:56:43.000000', NULL, 1),
