(6491608, 964700, 66398, '<td valign="top">This is an intersting take on the challenge. It meets the challenge criteria imo however it seems a little cluttered to me and I don''t get much of the sky or skyline part of it. Mostly what I see is the cityscape. At first I wasn''t sure what the to foreground parts were but, now I see they are clouds. And I keep trying to see into the dark parts on the left and top right to see more of the "skyline" part of it but, it''s too dark to see anything.</td>', 'This is an intersting take on the challenge. It meets the challenge criteria imo however it seems a little cluttered to me and I don''t get much of the sky or skyline part of it. Mostly what I see is the cityscape. At first I wasn''t sure what the to foreground parts were but, now I see they are clouds. And I keep trying to see into the dark parts on the left and top right to see more of the "skyline" part of it but, it''s too dark to see anything.', '2011-08-03 15:45:50.000000', NULL, 1),
