(6491771, 964478, 108069, '<td valign="top">Nice tones, sharp and clean. Very nice shot. As a Yankees fan I hope it topples into the water, but I can hardly think of a nicer photo for the sad citizens to reflect on.</td>', 'Nice tones, sharp and clean. Very nice shot. As a Yankees fan I hope it topples into the water, but I can hardly think of a nicer photo for the sad citizens to reflect on.', '2011-08-03 18:17:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6491773, 964949, 108069, '<td valign="top">Cery nice tones. Clean and sharp. Nice.</td>', 'Cery nice tones. Clean and sharp. Nice.', '2011-08-03 18:20:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6491778, 964699, 108069, '<td valign="top">A truly classic view, and the tones and sharpness give it a bit of grit and raw reality, as it should. Plus, it''s very refreshing to see this after a shot of the Boston skyline. What a waste of a shutter actuation that was.</td>', 'A truly classic view, and the tones and sharpness give it a bit of grit and raw reality, as it should. Plus, it''s very refreshing to see this after a shot of the Boston skyline. What a waste of a shutter actuation that was.', '2011-08-03 18:22:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6491880, 964528, 108069, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. Great range of tones and contrast, representing the entire spectrum. This surprising seems to be a rare treat. Lovely clouds. Sharp, clean. Excellent photo.<br/> <br/>I''m not voting so don''t lose any sleep over my critique of the border: I don''t like it. First off, it steals too much space from this very nice photo. Secondly, the thick white line is, for lack of better words, not very classy, if that makes sense.  A 1-px-wide white line would have nicely set it off, subtly. The thick white line is just too much. I may have even preferred just a black frame. But to be honest, since we only have 300 pixels to work with, no frame is even better. Anyway, take it as one man''s opinion, which is as valuable as the next''s.</td>', 'Nicely done. Great range of tones and contrast, representing the entire spectrum. This surprising seems to be a rare treat. Lovely clouds. Sharp, clean. Excellent photo. I''m not voting so don''t lose any sleep over my critique of the border: I don''t like it. First off, it steals too much space from this very nice photo. Secondly, the thick white line is, for lack of better words, not very classy, if that makes sense.  A 1-px-wide white line would have nicely set it off, subtly. The thick white line is just too much. I may have even preferred just a black frame. But to be honest, since we only have 300 pixels to work with, no frame is even better. Anyway, take it as one man''s opinion, which is as valuable as the next''s.', '2011-08-03 19:41:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6491882, 964339, 108069, '<td valign="top">Very nice story here, and the title hits it home further. Very interesting scene. Almost a horizontal triptych of three conflicting environments. Nice tones, muted colors. One of the more interesting images for sure.</td>', 'Very nice story here, and the title hits it home further. Very interesting scene. Almost a horizontal triptych of three conflicting environments. Nice tones, muted colors. One of the more interesting images for sure.', '2011-08-03 19:44:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6491884, 964325, 108069, '<td valign="top">Very nice long exposure work. I do want to curse you though, as I was also there last week but don''t have the tools for that (at the hour I was there). Sharp vs. smooth contrast is sweet. Well done.</td>', 'Very nice long exposure work. I do want to curse you though, as I was also there last week but don''t have the tools for that (at the hour I was there). Sharp vs. smooth contrast is sweet. Well done.', '2011-08-03 19:49:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6492009, 964132, 126371, '<td valign="top">Cool shot. I like the levels and subjects a lot. IMO, more room on the left would be nice?</td>', 'Cool shot. I like the levels and subjects a lot. IMO, more room on the left would be nice?', '2011-08-03 21:33:50.000000', NULL, 1),
