(6498037, 964835, 50641, '<td valign="top">What?  No kneejerk comments about how you needed to put the horizon on the thirds?  I think this works splendidly cut in half.  It feels so expansive, much larger than its 800px ;-) Coloring is vibrant but not over the top.  Congrats on top 20!</td>', 'What?  No kneejerk comments about how you needed to put the horizon on the thirds?  I think this works splendidly cut in half.  It feels so expansive, much larger than its 800px ;-) Coloring is vibrant but not over the top.  Congrats on top 20!', '2011-08-08 12:58:25.000000', NULL, 0),
